    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide GRAH</label><div><h5>Overview GRAH</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news. GRAH</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage). GRAH</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts GRAH</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette GRAH</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing) GRAH</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette) GRAH</li><li>Enter in search: start search GRAH</li><li>ESC: close modals GRAH</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites GRAH</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock GRAH</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete GRAH</h5><ul><li>Bangs:  GRAH!g  GRAH!ddg  GRAH!bing  GRAH!yt  GRAH!wiki  GRAH!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings;  GRAH{q} as placeholder GRAH</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset) GRAH</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search GRAH</li></ul><h5>Tiles GRAH</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open GRAH</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite GRAH</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites GRAH</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout GRAH</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget GRAH</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal) GRAH</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults GRAH</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card GRAH</li></ul><h5>Background GRAH</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval) GRAH</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background GRAH</li></ul><h5>Data GRAH</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON GRAH</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo) GRAH</li></ul></div></div>"
